rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0dc99ca7d329c3dd6acf6bed95fddd60, https://si.imgix.net/3a469f0d/uploads/origins/663a1abb-b81b-4682-8097-55075aac8dee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c128f4624462a46fbcbede2a4a221bd1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3a469f0d/uploads/origins/663a1abb-b81b-4682-8097-55075aac8dee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cee0b37938e3de4e07665721026e9cd0 3x"}, "body": "I made a mistake in the price and tried to resend it, but I guess I wasn't able to. We apologize for the inconvenience.\n\nMs. Nori, thank you so much for the wonderful illustrations you did for us before! I really love the OCs you draw and they are so cute, so please do another one!\n\nI really love your OC illustrations, so I would like to have them again!\n\nRange of depictions: Up to you.\n\nComposition and other images\nThe woman blushes when the man she loves pats her on the head and stares at her with tearful eyes.\nShe turns her head and looks at him with tearful eyes.\nThe face of a man who is smiling.\nI couldn't narrow it down to just one, so I would like you to draw all of them like a color rough sketch. If it is too difficult, please use only one of them. Of course, anything other than the above would be fine.\n Also, when you draw the one for \"To the man I love,\" please make sure that the man's hands are so white that they are almost pure white.\n\nDetails of appearance, personality, etc.\nRefer to the image at the URL.\n\nWe have seen the movie that Nori-sensei wrote the script and did the animation for. We really love the world view that only Nori-sensei can create and express. If the price is not suitable, you can cancel the offer. Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/KPHueyXswAtySrKW7", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@norito_mw_/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, 